{
    "id": "ssg",
    "title": "Static Site Generation",
    "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#06B6D4\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Prism's **SSG (Static Site Generation)** transforms your dynamic Photon application into a high-performance, edge-cacheable distribution. Deploy everywhere, scale infinitely.</p></div><h2>The Freeze Protocol</h2><p>Our SSG strategy, internally known as the <strong>Freeze Protocol</strong>, pre-computes your entire route graph at build time. It eliminates server-side latency by moving the execution phase to your CI/CD pipeline.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">EDGE_READY</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Generated files are simple HTML/JS/CSS. Host them on Cloudflare Pages or Vercel Edge for sub-10ms delivery.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">ZERO_RUNTIME</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">No Node.js/Bun process is needed at runtime. Your site is effectively immune to backend CPU spikes.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6,182,212,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"m16 12-4 4-4-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8v8\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">SEO_OPTIMIZED</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Fully rendered HTML allows search bots to index your content without executing heavy client-side scripts.</p></div></div><h2>Integration Workflow</h2><p>Static exporting is a core feature of the Prism engine. It uses in-memory request simulation to render your views without a live network socket.</p><pre><code>import { PlanetCore } from '@gravito/core'\nimport { OrbitPrism, StaticSiteGenerator } from '@gravito/prism'\n\nconst core = await PlanetCore.boot(config)\nconst ssg = new StaticSiteGenerator(core)\n\n// Pre-render the entire application to the dist folder\nawait ssg.export('./dist/static')</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #06B6D4; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// BUILD_SPEC: ATOMIC_CRAWLING</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">The SSG engine performs a non-destructive crawl of your router. It automatically detects all defined GET routes and recursively renders them into a deterministic directory structure.</p></div><h2>The StaticLink Component</h2><p>When switching between SSR and SSG modes, navigation can be tricky. We provide <code>StaticLink</code> to handle the environment transition seamlessly.</p><pre><code>import { StaticLink } from '@gravito/freeze-react'\n\n// Automatically uses &lt;a&gt; tags in static mode \n// and &lt;Link&gt; in dynamic Inertia mode\n&lt;StaticLink href=\"/docs\"&gt;Documentation&lt;/StaticLink&gt;</code></pre><h2>Performance: Time-to-First-Byte (TTFB)</h2><p>SSG delivery vs Dynamic SSR in a multi-region deployment.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>SSG_EDGE_CACHE</span> <span>~8ms TTFB</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #06B6D4; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6,182,212,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>DYNAMIC_SSR_REQUEST</span> <span>~450ms Latency</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 90%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// METRIC: SSG REDUCES LATEST-MILE LATENCY BY OVER 98%</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Architect's Insight:</strong> Static sites are the ultimate form of infrastructure optimization. By freezing your application state into immutable files, you achieve a level of security and reliability that no dynamic server can ever match.</p></div>",
